476
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,350
Okay, that sounds fair.

477
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:30,310
That just means, once again, we can't...

478
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:30,310
I know.

479
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:34,360
